---
title: Kneeling Medium-Grip Push-Ups
type: docs
prev: docs/grud/
---
![отжимания на коленях со средней постановкой рук](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5788b20f-35a3-4c84-935a-4fad6eb0f2d9)


{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Get onto your knees and place your hands flat on the floor shoulder-width apart, aligned with your upper chest.

### Step 2
Straighten your torso into a solid line and lower your chest toward the floor.

### Step 3
Let your elbows point slightly back and outward as you lower down.

### Step 4
From the bottom position, push through your hands and press your body back up until your arms are extended.


{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
• Perform every movement slowly and with control, focusing on muscle contraction.

• Keep your body in a straight line from your head through your hips to your knees throughout the entire set.

• Do not use momentum—lift your upper body using muscle strength alone.
{{< /callout >}}
